randomized fuzz inputs** (digits/signs/whitespace/junk bytes) — all byte-identical.\n- `c_src/` untouched (files retain their original timestamps).\n\nArtifacts: `Cargo.toml`, `src/main.rs`, binary at `target/release/driver`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1166,"cache_read_input_tokens":24914,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1166,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"13fcb5e3-9eef-4d75-8ede-e2e39ddbb0ea","uuid":"40983e68-931a-4c5b-9b68-04bb31e95789","timestamp":"2026-08-17T20:34:23.575Z"}
